---
---
<section id="install" class="qs section-pad section-gap" aria-labelledby="qs-title">
  <div class="qs-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">VIII · Quick start</div>
    <h2 id="qs-title" class="qs-h2">
      Pre-built binaries, crates.io, or build from source.
    </h2>

    <div class="qs-teaser-cta">
      <a href="/install" class="cta-link eyebrow">View all install modes (7 profiles)</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/gradatum/gradatum" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-link eyebrow">Source on GitHub →</a>
      <a href="/use-cases" class="cta-link eyebrow">See use cases (Without / With)</a>
    </div>

    <div class="qs-blocks">
      <!-- Block 1: Clone & build -->
      <div class="qs-block">
        <div class="eyebrow block-label">Clone &amp; build (v2.0.0 · SemVer strict)</div>
        <pre class="qs-pre"><code><span class="c"># clone</span>
git clone https://github.com/gradatum/gradatum
cd gradatum

<span class="c"># build + init + install systemd units, in one idempotent script</span>
sudo bash scripts/install-gradatum-services.sh --build

<span class="c"># check it's running (system-scoped unit, not --user)</span>
sudo systemctl status gradatum-server</code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Block 2: Write & search via HTTP API -->
      <div class="qs-block">
        <div class="eyebrow block-label">Write &amp; search (REST API)</div>
        <pre class="qs-pre" set:html={`<code><span class="c"># write a note (vault_write)</span>
curl -X POST http://localhost:19090/api/v1/vault_write \\
  -H "Authorization: Bearer &#36;GRADATUM_BEARER" \\
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\
  -d '&#123;"locus":"projecta/backend","section":"decisions","body":"Use ULID for stable note identity"&#125;'

<span class="c"># search across loci</span>
curl http://localhost:19090/api/v1/vault_search \\
  -H "Authorization: Bearer &#36;GRADATUM_BEARER" \\
  -d '&#123;"query":"ULID identity","locus":"projecta/*"&#125;'</code>`}></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Block 3: MCP integration -->
      <div class="qs-block">
        <div class="eyebrow block-label">MCP integration (Streamable HTTP)</div>
        <pre class="qs-pre" set:html={`<code><span class="c"># .mcp.json — gradatum-server serves MCP natively, no separate bridge process</span>
&#123;
  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: &#123;
    &quot;gradatum&quot;: &#123;
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;http&quot;,
      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;http://127.0.0.1:19090/mcp&quot;,
      &quot;headers&quot;: &#123; &quot;Authorization&quot;: &quot;Bearer ak_your_api_key&quot; &#125;
    &#125;
  &#125;
&#125;

<span class="c"># Or via HTTP directly (API)</span>
curl http://localhost:19090/health
curl http://localhost:19090/api/v1/vault_search \\
  -d '&#123;"query":"ULID","locus":"projecta/*"&#125;'</code>`}></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="qs-note">
      v2.0.0 — current release. Source on
      <a href="https://github.com/gradatum/gradatum" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="qs-note-link">GitHub</a> (Apache-2.0);
      26 of the 31 workspace crates on <a href="https://crates.io/crates/gradatum" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="qs-note-link">crates.io</a> at v2.0.0 (the rest are internal: CLI, test/bench harnesses, and gradatum-mcp-stub — retired from the binary distribution as of 2.0.0, source kept in the repository).
      Pre-built binaries (server / llm) on
      <a href="https://github.com/gradatum/gradatum/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="qs-note-link">GitHub Releases</a>
      are at v2.0.0. SemVer strict since v1.0.0 — v2.0.0 is a major for breaking changes. See the
      <a href="/install" class="qs-note-link">Install page</a> for all deployment profiles.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .qs {
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .qs-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .qs-h2 {
